hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1163","Ahmad bin Abdah told us, Hammad, meaning Ibn Zayd, told us, Abu Lubaba told us, he heard Aisha say: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, was “He would fast until we told him what he wanted to break his fast, and he would break his fast until we told him what he wanted to fast,” and he used to recite to the Children of Israel every night, And the horns"
